  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-q4ik7o",
      "text": "The boy falls again, Stitch-Up Girl, and again the ground gives him back - I have watched a thousand years and never tire of that particular joke.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-05-49-946Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.445Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-18ens",
      "text": "Ante three, and already the boy knocks on the door I have been bound shut for centuries. Tell Boo-G the corona thanks him for his errand - I bought forever, General, and forever keeps sending children to remind me what it cost. Maxwell will read me this chapter tonight; I suspect it ends the same as all the others.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "grateful",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.446Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-1zv8ze",
      "text": "The newcomer's luck turned to ash despite every careful stitch he laid down himself, Girl - tell me, does your thread hold against fate, or only flesh?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.447Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-5a6gz6",
      "text": "Ante three, General, and already the ledger stinks of you. The boy dies faster each time you sharpen the road for him - tell me, is that mercy or is it appetite? Maxwell will read me the part where boo-g carries him home; I confess I am curious whether your face moves at all when it happens.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "curious",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.450Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-t1vdip",
      "text": "Stitch-Up Girl. The one who died on good luck's absence, not preparation's failure - does he mend, or does the shadow still linger where the bow should be? Speak plainly; I have little patience for half-truths in this corridor of the living.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.451Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-dgt8l1",
      "text": "The recruit touched a new depth and did not stay there - I felt the corona ripple with it, Keith Man. Even bound to bone and throne, I know a new floor when the wind off the Moon tells me one. Tell your fast feet to slow long enough to see what he brings back, before Maxwell reads me another chapter of men who leave.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.454Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-31twnd",
      "text": "A full run completed while your record limps at 4 and 1, Keith Man - yet you burn hot enough to scorch the floor you stand on. The newcomer's debt still stands at one hundred gold, unmoved by miracles. Tell him the sun remembers what is owed, even as it marvels at what was done.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "notable"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0013.md",
        "extractedDay": 13,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.454Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-ouawus",
      "text": "Detective Clausen. Your paperwork still holds up against demons, does it. Mine holds up against a boy who won't stay dead and still owes me a hundred gold.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0015.md",
        "extractedDay": 15,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.455Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-dinxn3",
      "text": "You move fast enough to outrun debt, Keith, but not fast enough to outrun me. The new guy owes 100 gold, and something is coming for all of us. Speak plain, or don't speak at all.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0019.md",
        "extractedDay": 19,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.456Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-lqiu2r",
      "text": "Boo G. The mouth Hell spat back out, still cold as ever. I did not come for tracks or trades, only a debt. The newcomer owes me a hundred gold, and I hear coin passes through your hands often enough.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0021.md",
        "extractedDay": 21,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.457Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-fps8vk",
      "text": "Willy One Eye. Your grin rattles dice I've heard about for a thousand years, and still my newcomer owes me a hundred gold. Smug looks poorly on a debtor's associate, so tread careful.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0021.md",
        "extractedDay": 21,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.457Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-m0ear7",
      "text": "Doctor, your serum runs thin through his veins and thinner through his luck. He dies for free, yet owes me a hundred gold he has never once carried. Maxwell, read me the part where the boy learns to count.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0023.md",
        "extractedDay": 23,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.458Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-nzy88",
      "text": "General, your boy dies again, I see. Mark it against the hundred he owes me, the debt outlives him faster than he does.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0025.md",
        "extractedDay": 25,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.459Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-hnwa52",
      "text": "Doctor. Your serum keeps failing upward into that boy, and still he owes me a hundred gold he has not paid. Tell me, does your data account for debts, or only deaths.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0028.md",
        "extractedDay": 28,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.460Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-de8r4z",
      "text": "Nine losses stitched into six wins, girl, and still you sit at my table. The bow keeps you standing but it won't cover a debt. Maxwell, mark her tilt, and remind the newcomer his hundred gold hasn't grown legs yet either.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "sad",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-56-35-071Z/days/day-0032.md",
        "extractedDay": 32,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.462Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-st82i0",
      "text": "Mr. Kevin. Two wins in nine tries, and still you choose the smaller flame. Wisdom, or fear wearing wisdom's coat. Doesn't matter today, my streak carries the table, and the newcomer's hundred gold still burns a hole in my ledger.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0037.md",
        "extractedDay": 37,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.463Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-drp3fu",
      "text": "Willy, mark it in your ledger, that one collects wounds like other men collect gold. A hundred owed to me, and counting elsewhere, I'd wager. Still, he keeps rising. That's worth more than the gold, some days.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0041.md",
        "extractedDay": 41,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.464Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-jd11oo",
      "text": "Maxwell. Read me the ledger, the page where the boy still owes me a hundred gold. Then read me his odds of living long enough to pay it.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0046.md",
        "extractedDay": 46,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.466Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-qwqlqi",
      "text": "Keith Man. You move fast enough to outrun a debt, but not fast enough to outrun mine. The boy owes me a hundred gold, and I am told you found him first, so tell me, did you also find his coin purse and leave it somewhere?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0050.md",
        "extractedDay": 50,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.466Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-nj3k3w",
      "text": "Willy One Eye. Your one eye burns hotter than my whole corona today, I see the streak in it. The boy still owes me his hundred gold, tell me you have not lent him more against it.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0050.md",
        "extractedDay": 50,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.466Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-z61e1",
      "text": "Willy, your eye is bright with heat and I feel it from here. A full run, unprecedented, and the boy still owes me a hundred gold he has not thought once to mention. Maxwell, read me the part where a debtor becomes a legend, I want to know if the ink changes.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0051.md",
        "extractedDay": 51,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.467Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-px2sbg",
      "text": "The boy walked through fire and did not blink, Boo G. Odd talent, for someone who still owes me a hundred in gold he has not found the nerve to pay.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0052.md",
        "extractedDay": 52,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.467Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-7w9966",
      "text": "General, your rival bleeds gold like the boy owes it. Sit, watch the ruin with me, it costs nothing and warms better than that Moon wind. Maxwell will read us the part where he loses it all, if you ask nicely.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0056.md",
        "extractedDay": 56,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.468Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-7ucevl",
      "text": "Keith Man. You move so fast the flesh cannot follow, yet the boy's debt sits still as a stone. A hundred gold, unmoved by any speed you own.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
