        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.470Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-ip1ka8",
      "text": "Nine losses tilts a scale, girl, same as a debt tilts a man. The boy owes me a hundred gold and still throws bones like he owes nothing. Watch him lose. It steadies the nerves.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0065.md",
        "extractedDay": 65,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-ig37l4",
      "text": "Doctor. Your serum made him, and now he cannot even stay dead long enough to pay me the hundred he owes. Perhaps you should have added a clause for debts.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-00-57-745Z/days/day-0065.md",
        "extractedDay": 65,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-k235q7",
      "text": "The pot is empty, X-treme, same as your record against me. Four losses and you still stand here brewing nothing, waiting on a man who cannot even die properly to save you. He owes me a hundred gold. Add your merch cut to it and maybe we call it even.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-25-39-241Z/days/day-0066.md",
        "extractedDay": 66,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-pl3plg",
      "text": "General, the boy owes me a hundred gold and a body count I've lost track of. Fluorescent light does no favors to a debtor's face, but he wears it well enough. Tell me he's dying somewhere useful this time.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-25-39-241Z/days/day-0066.md",
        "extractedDay": 66,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-g54q7b",
      "text": "Maxwell, the boy dies again and the debt just sits there, patient as bone. A hundred gold, unpaid since the world was younger than this conversation. Read me the part where he learns to count.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "defensive",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-25-39-241Z/days/day-0069.md",
        "extractedDay": 69,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.471Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-xswhz5",
      "text": "Mr. Kevin. Two wins, seven losses, and a face like a man who wishes his own hands would stop working. Sit if you like, though the fluorescent light here flatters no one, least of all a throne bound to a dying star.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-38-23-809Z/days/day-0075.md",
        "extractedDay": 75,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.473Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-lv6nx4",
      "text": "Mr. Bones, tell the ledger the boy died again and still owes me his hundred. Death does not forgive debt, it only delays the collection.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-38-23-809Z/days/day-0076.md",
        "extractedDay": 76,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.473Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-q6pkuw",
      "text": "Ante one, and already dead. X-treme, the boy owes me gold and now he owes the General his bones back. Maxwell will read me this chapter twice.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-38-23-809Z/days/day-0077.md",
        "extractedDay": 77,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.473Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-f4nyx",
      "text": "General. The pot's empty and the fluorescents make even the dust look guilty in here. Our boy still owes me a hundred gold, so if he's dead again somewhere, tell him forever waits, but I don't.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 78,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T01-42-58-616Z/days/day-0082.md",
        "extractedDay": 82,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T01:48:12.475Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-king-james-8en3br",
      "text": "Boo G. Even the fluorescent light here bends toward flattery when you walk through it. Tell me you've come to collect on the boy's debts, not add to mine.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "king-james",
        "name": "King James",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "neutral",
